WEBVTT

00:00.490 --> 00:02.970
Great Witch, would you like to get married?

00:02.970 --> 00:04.460
Run, run, run, run, run, run...

00:03.470 --> 00:05.870
Wait! Don't get the wrong idea!

00:05.870 --> 00:07.480
I didn't mean with me!

00:07.770 --> 00:10.470
I have no intention of marrying anyone!

00:10.470 --> 00:13.360
Please, just hear me out!

00:13.360 --> 00:18.890
"Find your ideal partner in the 
nature-rich village of Tazine.

00:18.890 --> 00:22.270
Hold your wedding ceremony at the 
temple of the pine spirit Misjantie,

00:22.270 --> 00:24.680
a place steeped in tradition.

00:24.680 --> 00:27.820
Come join our matchmaking party."

00:27.820 --> 00:29.430
Matchmaking party?

00:30.850 --> 00:33.860
Tazine is a small village,

00:33.860 --> 00:37.380
and it's been struggling with 
its declining population.

00:37.380 --> 00:43.670
So the guild's top brass has been pushing 
me to send one of our young folks there.

00:44.030 --> 00:47.570
It's not easy being a 
guild receptionist, huh?

00:47.850 --> 00:50.700
Please! All you'd need to do is show up!

00:50.700 --> 00:52.440
Just as a formality!

00:52.440 --> 00:57.420
Hmm... Can I go there to see the 
sights and just drop in on the way?

00:57.420 --> 00:59.450
Yes! That would be just fine!

00:59.930 --> 01:02.710
Okay, I guess I'll go, then.

01:03.530 --> 01:05.760
Thank you so much!

01:05.760 --> 01:09.620
You should bring Halkara and Flatorte along

01:09.620 --> 01:11.960
so the four of us can make 
it a ladies' outing!

01:12.260 --> 01:13.420
Four of us?

01:13.950 --> 01:16.210
Yes! I'll be going with you!

01:16.450 --> 01:18.720
What?! You're going, too?

01:19.290 --> 01:21.960
Let's all have a happy wedding!

01:33.570 --> 01:44.580
<b>I've Been Killing Slimes for 300 Years
and Maxed Out My Level Season 2</b>

02:57.030 --> 02:59.820
<b>I Met a Pine Spirit</b>

02:58.120 --> 03:01.570
I'm not interested in marriage anymore.

03:01.570 --> 03:06.600
Same here. My work is more 
important to me right now.

03:06.600 --> 03:10.820
Yeah, same. But the matchmaking 
party can just be a—

03:09.730 --> 03:10.820
Everyone!

03:10.820 --> 03:16.220
At the party, we'll have the Great Witch 
start up a conversation with the men,

03:16.220 --> 03:20.280
and then Halkara will share a quick 
anecdote to loosen everyone up.

03:20.280 --> 03:25.040
And toward the end, Flatorte, I'd like 
you to propose exchanging contact info!

03:25.930 --> 03:27.220
Uh-huh...

03:27.220 --> 03:31.400
No need to worry! 
It'll be my job to back you up!

03:31.400 --> 03:37.240
Let's all work together to bag some rich, 
handsome, highly-educated men!

03:37.530 --> 03:40.340
You sure are fired up, Natalie.

03:51.810 --> 03:55.380
This is Tazine's shopping district, right?

03:55.380 --> 03:56.670
Yes...

03:56.670 --> 04:01.550
It used to be prosperous and 
filled with shoppers, but now...

04:02.150 --> 04:04.510
It's really gone downhill.

04:04.510 --> 04:07.010
Anyway, let's head to the party venue!

04:07.010 --> 04:09.670
The handsome men should all be there!

04:07.640 --> 04:10.270
<b>Party Venue</b>

04:15.880 --> 04:17.530
Handsome men...

04:20.180 --> 04:23.070
Why don't we start with some sightseeing?

04:23.530 --> 04:28.530
<b>Misjantie Temple</b>

04:24.040 --> 04:26.310
This is Tazine's top tourist attraction,

04:26.310 --> 04:28.530
the Misjantie Temple.

04:28.840 --> 04:32.590
The pine spirit enshrined here, Misjantie,

04:32.590 --> 04:36.540
is well-known as a spirit 
who blesses marriages.

04:36.800 --> 04:40.410
The village is falling apart, 
but the temple sure looks well-kept.

04:40.730 --> 04:43.670
It must've brought in a 
lot of money in the past.

04:43.670 --> 04:48.190
I thought it'd be full of people praying 
for success in finding a partner.

04:48.570 --> 04:50.180
Right, Natalie?

04:51.540 --> 04:53.770
I guess the prayers didn't work.

04:53.770 --> 04:56.690
I can hear the lonely cry of the cuckoo now.

04:57.090 --> 04:58.440
<i>Natalie...</i>

05:01.820 --> 05:02.750
Huh?

05:07.820 --> 05:09.460
Who are you?

05:09.460 --> 05:11.070
What? You can see me?

05:11.420 --> 05:15.330
I try to stay invisible 
to ordinary humans...

05:15.810 --> 05:18.840
I'm the pine spirit, Misjantie.

05:18.840 --> 05:20.910
Oh, so you're her?

05:21.400 --> 05:27.500
Mediating marriages is more like my real 
job than the pine spirit thing, though.

05:27.500 --> 05:31.790
But as the village declines, 
there are fewer couples getting married,

05:31.790 --> 05:33.650
so my business is a bust.

05:34.640 --> 05:37.570
Master, is someone here?

05:39.830 --> 05:41.930
It's a gloomy-looking woman.

05:41.930 --> 05:43.450
Huh?!

05:43.450 --> 05:46.230
How are there two humans here 
who are high-level enough

05:46.230 --> 05:49.050
to see a spirit who's 
concealing her presence?!

05:49.550 --> 05:51.030
What <i>are</i> you?

05:51.030 --> 05:53.310
I told you, I'm a pine spirit!

05:53.310 --> 05:55.580
What's going on, exactly?

05:55.580 --> 05:58.330
I'm actually a pretty 
prestigious spirit, you know!

05:58.540 --> 06:03.840
Misjantie, could you make yourself visible 
to everyone? You're confusing people.

06:05.050 --> 06:09.850
Okay, okay! Just get this 
dragon girl off of me!

06:10.190 --> 06:12.860
So you're the pine spirit?

06:13.130 --> 06:15.620
You should have said so sooner.

06:15.620 --> 06:17.100
I did!

06:17.100 --> 06:19.240
Excuse me, Madam Spirit!

06:19.240 --> 06:20.600
Yeah?

06:20.890 --> 06:25.480
Could you use your spirit powers 
to help me find a good partner?

06:25.480 --> 06:29.620
Like a rich, handsome, highly-educated man!

06:29.620 --> 06:31.620
Hard to find one who's highly educated.

06:32.730 --> 06:36.000
A handsome man who makes lots 
of money, then, please!

06:36.430 --> 06:38.490
Not many who make that much money, either.

06:38.790 --> 06:40.160
All right, fine!

06:40.160 --> 06:42.870
I'll settle for anyone if I have to, 
as long as he's hot!

06:43.250 --> 06:45.880
<i>Only his looks still count in the end.</i>

06:45.880 --> 06:48.160
Can't help with that, either.

06:48.160 --> 06:51.140
My job is to mediate marriages, 
nothing more.

06:51.660 --> 06:53.010
No...

06:53.010 --> 06:56.770
You're lucky, though! 
I've got a good deal for you!

06:58.490 --> 07:02.390
There's a matchmaking party 
going on in Tazine right now.

07:02.390 --> 07:05.850
Go there, and you can find some real studs!

07:08.450 --> 07:11.290
We actually stopped by there already.

07:11.290 --> 07:13.650
What?! And it didn't work out?

07:16.910 --> 07:18.700
Yeah, it sure didn't.

07:19.350 --> 07:22.550
Great Witch, we needn't stay 
here long. Let's go home.

07:22.550 --> 07:24.850
Hang on a minute, please!

07:24.850 --> 07:28.550
The Misjantie Temple is 
seriously doomed at this rate!

07:28.780 --> 07:31.180
Please help me!

07:31.180 --> 07:34.680
Exactly how are we supposed 
to help you, though?

07:34.680 --> 07:38.840
I need one of you to get married and 
have the ceremony in my temple,

07:38.840 --> 07:41.860
and then say a prayer to the pine spirit!

07:41.860 --> 07:45.410
And then you'll get your powers back?

07:45.410 --> 07:49.130
Nope. But if you then 
make an offering to me,

07:49.130 --> 07:51.310
I'll get my economic strength back.

07:51.670 --> 07:53.310
<i>She just got real.</i>

07:53.310 --> 07:57.440
There isn't even anyone to marry, though.

07:57.770 --> 08:01.070
I've never seen a human 
threaten a spirit before...

08:01.520 --> 08:04.970
Sorry to say it, but we have 
no plans to get married.

08:06.700 --> 08:08.540
Not a problem!

08:08.540 --> 08:11.440
I have several marriage bundles 
you can choose from!

08:11.440 --> 08:16.100
No amount of bundles will make a difference 
if none of us gets married, right?

08:16.100 --> 08:19.720
There are plans that don't 
require you to get married!

08:19.720 --> 08:20.980
Such as...

08:23.530 --> 08:25.720
A sister wedding?

08:25.720 --> 08:26.920
Yeah!

08:26.920 --> 08:31.980
You hold a ceremony to promise that 
you'll always stay close as sisters.

08:32.240 --> 08:34.080
I wanna do that!

08:34.080 --> 08:36.930
It's always been my dream 
to wear a wedding dress!

08:36.930 --> 08:41.010
An older sister is one who looks 
after her younger siblings.

08:41.010 --> 08:44.750
In this case, it makes more 
sense for me to wear the dress.

08:44.750 --> 08:48.020
Aw, that's just a technicality!

08:48.020 --> 08:50.260
I wanna wear a wedding dress!

08:50.600 --> 08:53.130
This is the one thing I 
can't yield to you on.

08:55.630 --> 08:57.850
I see, I see.

08:57.850 --> 09:00.640
In that case, I have just the plan for you!

09:00.640 --> 09:04.150
I call it the "Two Tasty 
Treats in One" plan!

09:04.430 --> 09:07.030
And how does that work?

09:07.030 --> 09:09.700
Weddings are often very long.

09:09.700 --> 09:11.910
Some people change outfits partway through.

09:12.130 --> 09:14.660
<i>Ah, like changing for the reception!</i>

09:14.930 --> 09:18.780
How about you both appear 
in men's formal wear first,

09:18.780 --> 09:22.100
and then you both change into 
dresses for the latter half?

09:22.100 --> 09:23.920
That'll make things equal.

09:24.180 --> 09:28.090
That sounds good! 
I'd like to try wearing both, anyway!

09:28.090 --> 09:30.430
Yes. That kills two birds with one stone.

09:30.430 --> 09:34.270
Okay, Misjantie, could you 
set us up with that plan?

09:34.270 --> 09:35.660
You got it!

09:36.130 --> 09:39.170
Also, who will you be 
inviting to the ceremony?

09:39.910 --> 09:44.550
I know someone who'd be on my case for 
a century if I didn't invite her...

09:44.930 --> 09:47.940
<b>Department of Agriculture</b>

09:45.220 --> 09:47.940
What did you say?!

09:47.940 --> 09:50.810
A sister wedding?!

09:51.040 --> 09:53.660
Before you get the wrong idea,

09:53.660 --> 09:56.940
it's a ceremony where they promise 
they'll always stay close as sisters.

09:57.500 --> 10:03.010
Falfa and Shalsha aren't actually 
marrying anyone. Relax.

10:03.920 --> 10:05.780
What a relief.

10:05.780 --> 10:10.830
I might have had to do something to 
whomever they were going to marry.

10:11.290 --> 10:13.060
<i>What were you going to do?</i>

10:13.810 --> 10:16.900
So we can assume you'll be there, right?

10:16.900 --> 10:21.030
Of course! As their guardian, 
I am obligated to attend!

10:21.030 --> 10:23.050
I'm their guardian, actually.

10:23.480 --> 10:26.980
<b>I've Been Killing Slimes for 300 Years
and Maxed Out My Level Season 2</b>

10:30.490 --> 10:34.180
You're serving as the 
receptionist for the wedding?

10:34.180 --> 10:37.740
Yeah. Misjantie asked me to.

10:38.050 --> 10:40.500
Would you like us to help?

10:40.500 --> 10:42.510
Thanks, Laika.

10:42.510 --> 10:45.200
But this ceremony is for my daughters.

10:45.200 --> 10:48.870
As their mom, I have to do my part for them.

10:48.870 --> 10:51.350
Sister, isn't that...

10:52.540 --> 10:55.030
Good afternoon, everyone!

10:55.030 --> 10:56.720
I, Eno, the Witch of the Cave,

10:56.720 --> 11:01.020
am here to hand out my new 
Forest Drink to everyone!

11:01.290 --> 11:03.070
It speeds up your metabolism,

11:03.070 --> 11:06.510
giving you a healthy body without 
the need to overwork yourself!

11:07.340 --> 11:11.530
I guess all humans want to live 
as long as they possibly can.

11:11.860 --> 11:14.640
<i>I'm not sure if she sounds 
convincing or not...</i>

11:14.950 --> 11:20.660
It's sold locally as an en-mrfrf-y 
drink made by Hal-mrfr-a,

11:20.660 --> 11:26.570
but products you drink so you can work 
harder when you're tired aren't good for you.

11:26.570 --> 11:29.350
But my Forest Drink, on the other hand—

11:29.350 --> 11:32.950
Wait a minute! 
Why are you dissing my product?!

11:33.280 --> 11:40.320
And you know, eating proper meals every day 
is much healthier than drinking this stuff!

11:40.320 --> 11:41.800
Excuse me?!

11:41.800 --> 11:46.600
Well, getting lots of sleep will give 
you more energy than your energy drink!

11:48.600 --> 11:52.380
If you two are gonna start talking 
like that, you're both done.

11:52.380 --> 11:56.060
And could you not fight 
right now of all times?

11:59.660 --> 12:01.400
Congratulations, Azusa.

12:02.310 --> 12:05.920
If anything happens, come 
talk to me anytime, okay?

12:06.320 --> 12:08.660
I will, Momma. Thanks.

12:09.830 --> 12:12.370
Congratulations, Dear Sister!

12:12.370 --> 12:14.080
Congratulations.

12:14.080 --> 12:17.450
Beelzebub! You look so different today!

12:17.980 --> 12:20.650
This is my daughters' big day, after all.

12:20.650 --> 12:23.220
I had a new dress made.

12:23.220 --> 12:26.550
It'll be our turn next, Dear Sister!

12:26.550 --> 12:29.090
Yeah, that's not happening!

12:37.520 --> 12:40.270
Fightie! Did you run here again?

12:40.270 --> 12:43.580
Yes... It was great training.

12:44.090 --> 12:47.770
So how much money have 
they received as gifts?

12:48.150 --> 12:51.160
<i>Seriously, all she ever 
talks about is money.</i>

12:52.710 --> 12:56.200
Azusa! 
Congratulations on this happy occasion!

12:56.200 --> 12:58.830
Pondeli! How's the shop going?

12:58.830 --> 13:03.330
Great, thank you! I'm enjoying 
playing games and lazing around!

13:03.620 --> 13:07.910
<i>When you just hear the things she 
says, she's totally a recluse.</i>

13:09.500 --> 13:11.890
Congratulations, Great Witch!

13:11.890 --> 13:14.120
Natalie! We've been waiting for you!

13:14.120 --> 13:17.640
Incidentally, there will 
be a bouquet toss, right?

13:17.640 --> 13:20.400
I'm going to catch it, whatever it takes!

13:20.690 --> 13:24.190
<i>Typical Natalie. 
She's so eager to get married.</i>

13:31.530 --> 13:34.580
Mama, do we look okay in these tuxedos?

13:34.580 --> 13:36.780
I'm worried, too.

13:37.150 --> 13:40.100
You both look fantastic!

13:41.330 --> 13:44.280
Your mama will be watching 
you every moment, okay?

13:49.360 --> 13:52.730
Lady Azusa, this is a bit 
nerve-racking, isn't it?

13:52.730 --> 13:56.430
Yeah. It's more of a proper 
ceremony than I expected.

13:57.280 --> 13:58.440
Although...

13:58.760 --> 14:02.310
Why are you guys sitting 
in the family section?

14:02.310 --> 14:04.940
Don't be so cold, Dear Sister!

14:04.940 --> 14:07.560
We're practically family by now, aren't we?

14:07.560 --> 14:09.690
No, we're definitely not.

14:11.640 --> 14:15.460
I hope you two will be 
even happier from now on!

14:15.460 --> 14:18.020
They haven't even entered yet.

14:18.610 --> 14:23.330
Everyone, the pair celebrating 
today will now enter.

14:23.700 --> 14:26.350
Please welcome them with your applause!

14:33.950 --> 14:36.090
They look so dashing!

14:59.280 --> 15:02.530
I am Misjantie, the pine spirit.

15:02.530 --> 15:07.520
I'm here to see that these two continue 
to trust in each other always.

15:07.860 --> 15:12.630
Wise men have said since ancient times that 
all those with life shall one day perish,

15:12.630 --> 15:16.060
but that law only applies 
to physical bodies.

15:16.510 --> 15:18.320
The soul is immortal.

15:18.320 --> 15:23.990
I pray that the souls of these two will 
grow endlessly, forever and ever.

15:26.030 --> 15:30.180
Place these rings on each other's 
fingers with that wish in your hearts.

15:49.800 --> 15:52.210
What a wonderful ceremony!

15:52.210 --> 15:55.550
Falfa and Shalsha both look so happy!

15:55.550 --> 15:58.560
I'm impressed by Misjantie, too.

15:58.560 --> 16:00.640
I was a bit worried,

16:00.640 --> 16:04.300
but she really is a spirit 
who blesses weddings!

16:04.300 --> 16:06.690
Yeah. I'm so glad we did this.

16:07.500 --> 16:10.060
Mother of the newlyweds, 
please come with me.

16:10.060 --> 16:12.080
You have an important job to do!

16:15.900 --> 16:17.070
Right this way.

16:35.520 --> 16:39.320
Everyone, a round of applause for 
these two sisters in wedding dresses

16:39.320 --> 16:43.510
and the mother who will 
continue to watch over them!

16:49.210 --> 16:52.120
They're just too precious!

17:12.340 --> 17:15.140
Okay, Falfa, if you would.

17:18.000 --> 17:19.550
Dear Shalsha.

17:19.550 --> 17:24.630
When was it that you started 
to call me your big sister?

17:24.630 --> 17:27.970
It's been so long, I can't even remember.

17:28.500 --> 17:32.690
You've always had a tendency to 
get a bit too single-minded,

17:32.690 --> 17:35.650
to the point that you can't 
see anything else around you.

17:35.650 --> 17:39.330
Especially when you declared that 
you were going to kill Mama.

17:39.330 --> 17:41.030
That really surprised me.

17:41.400 --> 17:45.610
But if you hadn't come 
to attack Mama that day,

17:45.610 --> 17:50.100
we both might still be just living 
secretive lives in the forest today.

17:50.780 --> 17:55.490
I truly believe that you 
have brought me happiness.

17:56.850 --> 17:59.530
So let's always stay close, okay?

17:59.530 --> 18:00.630
From Falfa.

18:08.670 --> 18:10.170
Dear Sister.

18:10.170 --> 18:15.770
Sometimes I'm reminded that you're 
always looking out for me.

18:16.200 --> 18:19.110
When I tried to kill Mother,

18:19.110 --> 18:26.050
you reasoned with me, saying we could 
come up with a way to live happily.

18:26.370 --> 18:30.940
Because of that, I was able 
to become Mother's daughter.

18:30.940 --> 18:34.540
I wouldn't be who I am now 
if it hadn't been for you.

18:34.540 --> 18:37.720
I don't know how to repay you,

18:37.720 --> 18:40.300
but I ask that you continue 
to be there for me.

18:40.300 --> 18:41.540
From Shalsha.

18:46.690 --> 18:49.320
And now... for Mother.

18:49.780 --> 18:52.820
I'm glad I got to be your daughter.

18:53.680 --> 18:54.810
Thank you.

18:55.340 --> 18:59.830
Please... always stay... healthy and happy.

18:59.830 --> 19:02.530
I should be thanking you!

19:02.530 --> 19:04.840
Thank you for coming into my life!

19:12.480 --> 19:14.840
Those were beautiful speeches!

19:16.070 --> 19:17.330
Mama!

19:16.070 --> 19:17.330
Mother.

19:30.440 --> 19:33.100
Well done today, everyone!

19:33.100 --> 19:35.330
Thank you, Misjantie!

19:35.330 --> 19:38.110
It was a beautiful sister 
wedding because of you!

19:38.110 --> 19:40.230
I was really happy!

19:40.230 --> 19:42.350
I was also deeply moved.

19:42.660 --> 19:45.130
I'm just glad it made you all happy!

19:52.900 --> 19:56.620
Hey! What are you two doing?

19:56.960 --> 19:59.020
This is a pine sapling.

19:59.020 --> 20:02.010
Misjantie gave it to us in commemoration!

20:02.540 --> 20:05.750
I hope it grows into a big, 
strong pine tree someday.

20:11.950 --> 20:13.740
In just three days...

20:14.270 --> 20:16.560
...it grew this big?

20:16.560 --> 20:18.780
This is seriously in the way now.

20:18.780 --> 20:21.290
What's with this pompous-looking tree?

20:21.290 --> 20:23.660
I won't get as many nutrients 
from the soil now!

20:23.660 --> 20:25.920
A newcomer shouldn't be so impudent!

20:25.920 --> 20:28.850
So plants can be "newcomers," too?

20:28.850 --> 20:31.250
Mama, what's that?

20:31.250 --> 20:32.180
Huh?

20:35.450 --> 20:37.660
Oh, heya!

20:37.660 --> 20:40.930
Misjantie?! What are you doing here?!

20:41.360 --> 20:43.060
Take a look at this!

20:43.970 --> 20:46.590
"Misjantie Temple"...

20:46.590 --> 20:49.040
"House in the Highlands Branch"?!

20:52.340 --> 20:56.480
There's something mystical about a 
sapling growing in just three days,

20:56.480 --> 20:58.910
like it's a miracle from the spirits, right?

20:58.910 --> 21:01.840
So no one would find it strange 
if I built a temple here.

21:01.840 --> 21:05.290
I know you did something 
to make it grow that fast!

21:06.610 --> 21:08.710
Sorry about that.

21:08.710 --> 21:12.700
There's not much of a pine 
spirit following in Nanterre,

21:12.700 --> 21:17.420
so I thought if I expanded out here, 
there might be more weddings.

21:17.420 --> 21:21.980
Well, it's in the way here! 
Could you build it somewhere else, please?!

21:32.350 --> 21:36.850
<b>Misjantie Temple 
Flatta Village Branch</b>

21:38.040 --> 21:39.280
She put it <i>here</i>?

23:09.950 --> 23:12.450
<b>Days in the Highlands</b>

23:10.610 --> 23:12.450
Days in the Highlands!

23:12.950 --> 23:16.570
So this is the new Misjantie Temple, huh?

23:16.570 --> 23:18.580
Hot guys... Hot guys...

23:19.020 --> 23:22.580
Praying isn't enough. 
Offerings are important, too.

23:24.090 --> 23:25.840
<b>Part 2</b>

23:24.510 --> 23:25.830
Part 2!

23:25.830 --> 23:28.580
We found a really good slime!

23:28.580 --> 23:30.090
